sources.<br></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    As a subsidiary of LG Display, LG Display Vietnam Haiphong (LGDVH) plays a crucial role in developing and manufacturing OLED panels. With a vision to become the top business in Hai Phong by 2025, LGDVH has transformed its approach to Training &amp; Development and Reward &amp; Recognition, earning them the prestigious VIETNAM EXCELLENCE Award in these categories. </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
