          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Saint-Gobain is a global leader in construction materials and solutions, founded in France in 1665. Saint-Gobain Vietnam is a subsidiary of Saint-Gobain Group, offering a wide range of products and services for the construction industry under various brands, such as VINH TUONG, VINH TUONG-Gyproc, DURAflex, Weber, ISOVER, PAM, Vetrotech, Norton, Eurokera, ADFORS, SEKURIT12. Saint-Gobain Vietnam is committed to improving the quality of living and working spaces by providing innovative and sustainable solutions for life and the environment. Saint-Gobain’s mission is to make the world a better home.<br><br>COVID has put the businesses up against numerous challenges, following by the great resignation spreading across the market. By understanding and expressing CARE to every employee and their family, Saint-Gobain Vietnam has steadily been improving and innovating well-being activities to build up an open, safe, and happy working environment for employees. Health is highly prioritized at Saint-Gobain Vietnam, many policies and initiatives have been put in place early during the Covid-19 pandemic to ensure the health of employees, business &amp; partners. Afterwards, CARE Culture has been consistently driven in all activities.<br><br>At Saint-Gobain, TEC CULTURE is a core value with three key pillars that fosters a professional environment: TRUST - EMPOWERMENT – COLLABORATION. This helps the company build a trusted high-performance team, be faster in actions, and be more agile to adapt to customers’ needs.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
